{
  "name": "Day 60 Solution: Email & Calendar Triggers",
  "description": "Gmail Trigger flow that classifies email urgency with AI and logs every message, plus a Google Calendar Trigger flow that reminds attendees of upcoming meetings.",
  "tags": [
    "week9",
    "real-tools",
    "gmail",
    "calendar",
    "triggers"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 60 Solution: Email & Calendar Triggers\n\nTwo independent trigger-based flows: a Gmail Trigger flow that classifies and logs every incoming email (top), and a Google Calendar Trigger flow that sends meeting reminders to attendees (bottom).\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Gmail OAuth2, Google Calendar OAuth2 (same Google Cloud project as Gmail), Slack OAuth2, Airtable Personal Access Token, OpenAI API key.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_60_Email_Calendar_Triggers.md for the full task.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "polling-note-sticky",
      "name": "Polling vs Push",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Polling vs push\n\nBoth trigger nodes below use n8n's default **polling** mode (checks Gmail/Calendar on an interval, e.g. every 1-5 minutes). True push delivery needs Gmail push notifications via Google Cloud Pub/Sub -- lower latency, but more setup and its own failure modes to monitor. Polling is simpler and fine for most internal automations.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gmail-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 1: Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Email classification flow\nFires on new mail, classifies urgency with AI, alerts Slack for urgent mail, and logs every email either way.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calendar-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 2: Calendar Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        820
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Meeting reminder flow\nFires on event created/updated, checks for attendees, and reminds them by email.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger - New Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gmail-extract",
      "name": "Extract Email Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "email_from",
              "value": "={{ $json.from?.value?.[0]?.address || $json.from }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email_subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.subject || '(no subject)' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email_body",
              "value": "={{ $json.text || $json.snippet }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "classify-email",
      "name": "Classify Email Urgency",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You classify inbound email urgency. Respond ONLY with strict JSON: {\"urgency\": \"urgent\"|\"normal\", \"summary\": \"one line summary\"}. No other text."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Subject: ' + $json.email_subject + '\\nFrom: ' + $json.email_from + '\\nBody: ' + $json.email_body }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 150
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-classification",
      "name": "Parse AI Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1240,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "urgency",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).urgency }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ai_summary",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).summary }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email_from",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Email Fields').item.json.email_from }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email_subject",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Email Fields').item.json.email_subject }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-urgent",
      "name": "Is Urgent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-urgent-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.urgency }}",
              "rightValue": "urgent",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "post-urgent-alert",
      "name": "Post Urgent Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": "#urgent-inbox",
        "text": "={{ '\ud83d\udea8 Urgent email from ' + $json.email_from + '\\nSubject: ' + $json.email_subject + '\\nSummary: ' + $json.ai_summary }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-email",
      "name": "Log Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2020,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Email Log",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "From": "={{ $json.email_from }}",
            "Subject": "={{ $json.email_subject }}",
            "Urgency": "={{ $json.urgency }}",
            "Summary": "={{ $json.ai_summary }}",
            "Logged At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calendar-trigger",
      "name": "Google Calendar Trigger - Event Created/Updated",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "calendarId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_calendar_id@group.calendar.google.com",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "triggerOn": "eventUpdated",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-attendees",
      "name": "Has Attendees And Is Meeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "attendees-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.attendees?.length || 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "attendees-c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.summary }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-reminder",
      "name": "Send Reminder to Attendees",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        980,
        800
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ ($json.attendees || []).map(a => a.email).join(',') }}",
        "subject": "={{ 'Reminder: ' + $json.summary }}",
        "message": "={{ 'This is a reminder for \\'' + $json.summary + '\\'.\\nStart: ' + $json.start.dateTime + '\\nEnd: ' + $json.end.dateTime }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "skip-no-attendees",
      "name": "Skip - No Attendees",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        980,
        1000
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "skipped_reason",
              "value": "No attendees on this event -- treated as a personal reminder, not a meeting."
            },
            {
              "name": "event_summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger - New Email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Email Fields",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Email Fields": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Classify Email Urgency",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Classify Email Urgency": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse AI Classification",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse AI Classification": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is Urgent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is Urgent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Urgent Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Urgent Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Google Calendar Trigger - Event Created/Updated": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has Attendees And Is Meeting",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has Attendees And Is Meeting": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Reminder to Attendees",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Skip - No Attendees",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
